# The complete set of legacy writers that must be fenced before cutover authority
# can activate. Enumerated and confirmed against the repo and host state on
# 2026-08-04 (see docs/ops-issues.md, "Legacy-writer inventory — enumeration"):
# no other process writes to legacy SQLite/Asana. Update this set only after a
# fresh enumeration confirms it is still exhaustive.
REQUIRED_LEGACY_WRITER_INVENTORY = frozenset(
    {
        "dish-service-prod.service",
        "dish",
        "dish-admin",
    }
)

